          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why is my surface cleaner not spinning properly?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The usual causes are low water flow, a deck too large for the washer, partly blocked or worn nozzles, or a stiff swivel. Check the supply hose for kinks, clear the nozzles with a cleaning pin and spin the bar by hand to feel for roughness. A mismatched deck needs different nozzles or a smaller attachment."
          }
        }
